# The experience app's HTML shell.
#
# Prettier normalises void elements to `<meta … />` and lowercases the doctype;
# html-validate (which gates BUILT output, including this file) requires the
# omitted end tag and an uppercase doctype, matching what Astro emits for every
# other page. Both tools are right within their own remit and neither is
# configurable to agree, so the one hand-written HTML file in the repository is
# formatted to match the gate that ships rather than the formatter that does not.
apps/experience/index.html
